The implementation audit distinguishes completed repairs from the remaining integration work.

The persistent GSE epoch controller selects an eligible question under a pinned curriculum, commits a bounded ruling, derives a reviewed proposal, audits disjoint senses, migrates the admitted rule, and selects again from the resulting domains. Its forecasts simulate retirement of affected model assertions and are checked against the committed domain delta. Equal-budget comparisons retain the shared plan, model, source inventory, and question budget. Each plan still declares its hypothesis language and semantic warrants. The controller supplies a reproducible learning loop within that declaration. [Epoch controller](../../../../gse/gse/curation/lexicon_builder/epoch.py) · [Controller entry point](../../../../gse/scripts/run_lexicon_epochs.py)

Native scope predicates pass through the same definition identity, source evidence, resolver context, and replay path. The Wiktionary anatomy extension reuses the existing genus and attachment witness, with a separate BODY premise, for a candidate WANT rule. Its regression fixture exercises teaching, audit, migration, and replay while retaining unresolved mental-content and unsupported-source controls. New predicates therefore extend the existing rule language through its normal consumers. [Scope and replay tests](../../../../gse/tests/test_lexicon_epoch.py)

**Source-backed premises now enter discovery.** Version 2 of the reviewed-pattern input lets `guarded_patterns` use a replayed native/anchor baseline for a missing discovery premise. Automatic pair discovery also combines an existing baseline singleton with a reviewed target ruling. The report retains the baseline proof, rule fingerprint, and model review separately. It emits an unapproved observation; the rule's semantic warrant remains an admission obligation. Version 1 inputs retain their historical discovery semantics so old admission receipts can still be reproduced. The real CLI fixtures verify that the model is asked only about the unresolved target. [Premise-discovery tests](../../../../gse/tests/test_lexicon_builder_discovery_premises.py)

Guarded discovery can also reuse a baseline conclusion already justified by native evidence, anchors and admitted rules. Its `consequent_witness` retains the proof and baseline rule digest without inventing a model ruling. Unknown conclusions, explicit zeros, conflicts and contrary signs remain distinct. The qualified-stative source round composes this path with the existing exporter and audit entry points; the general epoch scheduler still needs automatic selection of such seeded continuations. [Source-proof discovery tests](../../../../gse/tests/test_lexicon_builder_reviewed_source_guards.py)

**Population staging now declares its inference semantics.** Version 2 requires `FORWARD_PRIOR` or `RELATIONAL_CONSTRAINT`. The relational path considers every definition and uses the same allowed-row solver as migration, including deductions that constrain an unknown antecedent. It loads full source evidence in bounded cohorts through the existing completion context index. The report retains exact conditional-conflict receipts and supported gains outside the withdrawn component. A forward-only stage explicitly requires a separate relational audit before relational installation. [Staging contract tests](../../../../gse/tests/test_lexicon_coherence_relational_stage.py)

The model-context transition has its own verification obligation. Migration archives active model receipts within a new rule's typed scope before reclosure. The general population stage evaluates current assertions, while the epoch forecast simulates the affected model-assertion retirements. The epoch migration then checks the exact resulting domain delta against that forecast. Extending this retirement-aware contract to the general population stage remains integration work.

**Review exceptions explicitly.** `admit_records` still checks positive discovery and held-out audits. `rule_revisions.py` compiles reviewed in-scope WordNet definition exceptions into exact applicability exclusions, including any that the warrant requires. The revision event retains the counterexample and source proof. Migration runs the full revised set together and refuses remaining unexplained conditional conflicts. The current exception adapter requires exact WordNet identity. A broader reusable exception condition needs a separately justified rule.

Revision format 2 additionally supports unresolved audit reservations through `rule_reservations.py`. It reuses exact native WordNet or Wiktionary identity witnesses, requires a valid null audit on an open target, and retains the source-backed review. A warranted child can require named reservations, which must be supplied in its atomic revision. Migration verifies preservation of each reserved domain, and replay preserves the historical evidence after later independent teaching. Signed counterexamples continue through the existing exception contract. [Reservation and replay tests](../../../../gse/tests/test_lexicon_builder_rule_reservations.py)

**Connect teaching and specialization back into execution.** Completion, reviewed export, refinement, audit, admission, and migration expose separately resumable stages. The atomic refinement command re-exports teaching from the pinned candidate, requires a reviewed observed pair, and uses the Regenesis learner on exact typed witnesses. Its report carries the rejected parent, opposing domains, candidate guards, and population counts. A reviewed guard can become a warranted child in the existing audit and migration path. Regenesis's narrative `corpus_fixpoint` returns `specialized` proposals from its finishing step. GSE's persistent epoch controller repeats teaching, audit, and propagation across declared families. Automatic scheduling of newly imputed revisions and reconsideration of reopened residuals across broader guard languages remain integration work.

**Make curriculum breadth measurable.** An epoch must report retained teaching by bank, sign, independent definition family, and reviewed status. Repeated correct zeros can still leave the bank interactions and boundary conditions underdetermined. Keep native constraints and archived decisions in their own counts. Use this census together with branch consequences and rule-scope discrimination to choose the next high-use, boundary, and coverage questions. The census diagnoses what the teaching can support; it is never a target distribution that licenses inventing signs.

Implement these contracts before treating a broad second stage as an admitted population migration. Use one end-to-end fixture that teaches a coordinate, derives a useful rule, encounters a genuine local contradiction, learns a typed refinement, reapplies it across several independent definitions, and reproduces the final candidate from the original evidence. Add adversarial cases for unknown versus zero, incorrect source identity, alias leakage, cyclic support, stale model context, rule-order changes, interrupted writes, and an unseen near counterexample. The expected artifact includes both the correct assignments and the preserved unresolved cases.

