If the local transport refuses an audit request for context length, preserve the failure receipt and retry the same request ID and output schema with a sufficient context window. Revalidate retained answers by replaying their original request, schema, raw response, and transport identity. A resource refusal supplies no semantic counterexample. Admission consumes the resulting complete audit alongside the explicit scope warrant.

In the executed cycle, 14,825 definitions opposed the unguarded parent. All six held-out audits agreed with the child, including two requests retried at 65,536 tokens. The additive migration reclosed 401,596 definitions and validated both preflight and postflight with complete support search. It retired the three teaching receipts and derived ALIVE=0 symbolically across 226 definitions, adding 223 assignments beyond the teaching stage. The checkpoint still has 22,085,312 unresolved cells and zero conflicted cells. Its release gate remains closed. [Initial audit](../../../../gse/docs/readings/2026-11-11-lexicon-learning-loop/alive-refined-audit.json), [completed audit](../../../../gse/docs/readings/2026-11-11-lexicon-learning-loop/alive-refined-audit-retry.json), [migration receipt](../../../../gse/docs/readings/2026-11-11-lexicon-learning-loop/alive-migration.json)

